<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.50-77.75. Holsteins - Large 2 600-700 lbs Few 60.00; 800-900 lbs 54.50-61.75.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 65.00-72.50; 700-800 lbs 63.50-67.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
